    for(const TCHAR* N:{TEXT("ChoiceIngressRpcGeneration"),TEXT("ChoiceIngressOutcomeGeneration")})AddTypedVariable(Proxy,N,MakeIntPinType());AddTypedVariable(Widget,TEXT("ChoiceIngressClicks"),MakeIntPinType(true));AddTypedVariable(Widget,TEXT("ChoiceIngressReady"),MakeBoolPinType());
    for(auto* BP:{Proxy,static_cast<UBlueprint*>(Widget)}){FBlueprintEditorUtils::MarkBlueprintAsStructurallyModified(BP);FKismetEditorUtilities::CompileBlueprint(BP);}
